00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.064
UNTIL THEY OPEN THE HEARINGS.

00:08:22.065 --> 00:08:23.032
&gt;&gt; Greg: YOU SHOULD BE HIS

00:08:23.033 --> 00:08:23.366
LATER.

00:08:23.367 --> 00:08:24.767
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: I FEEL STRONGLY

00:08:24.768 --> 00:08:25.368
ABOUT THIS.

00:08:25.369 --> 00:08:28.037
TO KENNEDY'S POINT THAT I SOUND

00:08:28.038 --> 00:08:29.305
LIKE JESSE WATERS, WE SHOULD ALL

00:08:29.306 --> 00:08:31.507
BE OFFENDED THAT WE SANG THIS

00:08:31.508 --> 00:08:32.909
RUSSIA DANCE FOR 2 1/2 YEARS AND

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:35.545
SPENT THIS MONEY FOR NOTHING.

00:08:35.546 --> 00:08:35.845
WHAT?

00:08:35.846 --> 00:08:36.779
THE STEELE DOSSIER?

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:37.547
GOLDEN CHAIR?

00:08:37.548 --> 00:08:39.248
WHAT DID THEY BASE THIS ON IN.

00:08:39.249 --> 00:08:40.016
&gt;&gt; Dana: OH, BOY.

00:08:40.017 --> 00:08:41.684
I DON'T KNOW WHAT YOU'RE TALKING

00:08:41.685 --> 00:08:41.984
ABOUT.

00:08:41.985 --> 00:08:42.852
&gt;&gt; Greg: WHAT'S THAT?

00:08:42.853 --> 00:08:44.620
&gt;&gt; Dana: LIKE THE GOLDEN CORRAL.

00:08:44.621 --> 00:08:46.255
IT'S A WONDERFUL BUFFET.

00:08:46.256 --> 00:08:48.991
MY SISTER LOVES THAT RESTAURANT

00:08:48.992 --> 00:08:49.425
SO MUCH.

00:08:49.426 --> 00:08:50.826
&gt;&gt; SO DOES ANY GRANDMOTHER.

00:08:50.827 --> 00:08:52.562
&gt;&gt; Dana: THEY'RE GOING TO HAVE

00:08:52.563 --> 00:08:53.329
PUBLIC HEARINGS IN NOVEMBER.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:55.431
&gt;&gt; THIS IS A TIME FOR AMERICANS

00:08:55.432 --> 00:08:57.934
AND LAWMAKERS TO REEVALUATE

00:08:57.935 --> 00:08:59.035
THEIR PAST DECISIONS.

00:08:59.036 --> 00:09:00.269
EVERYBODY LOVED THE FISA COURT

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.038
FOR SO LONG.

00:09:02.039 --> 00:09:03.272
REPUBLICANS AND DEMOCRATS

00:09:03.273 --> 00:09:05.141
RALLIED AROUND FOR THE FISA

00:09:05.142 --> 00:09:07.143
COURT AND LIBERTARIANS SAID

00:09:07.144 --> 00:09:07.843
DON'T TRUST IT.

00:09:07.844 --> 00:09:08.377
&gt;&gt; Dana: YES.

00:09:08.378 --> 00:09:10.680
&gt;&gt; ME AND YOU DISAGREE ON THAT.

00:09:10.681 --> 00:09:13.382
THERE'S NO DUE PROCESS.

00:09:13.383 --> 00:09:15.818
SO NOW WE HAVE INSTANCES WHERE

00:09:15.819 --> 00:09:17.787
AMERICANS ARE SPIED ON AND A

00:09:17.788 --> 00:09:18.588
SHAM INVESTIGATION AND THEY SAY

00:09:18.589 --> 00:09:21.223
AT LEAST WE GO A WARRANT FROM A

00:09:21.224 --> 00:09:22.091
FISA COURT.

00:09:22.092 --> 00:09:24.226
&gt;&gt; Dana: AND MICHAEL HOROWITZ,

00:09:24.227 --> 00:09:25.394
THE INSPECTOR GENERAL, SAYS IT'S

00:09:25.395 --> 00:09:26.796
WITHIN THE NEXT COUPLE WEEKS OR

00:09:26.797 --> 00:09:28.731
SO THAT WE'LL HAVE HIS REPORT

00:09:28.732 --> 00:09:31.834
THAT FOCUSES ONLY ON THE FBI'S

00:09:31.835 --> 00:09:32.134
ROLE.

00:09:32.135 --> 00:09:33.836
&gt;&gt; BUT NOW IT'S VERY

00:09:33.837 --> 00:09:34.236
INTERESTING.

00:09:34.237 --> 00:09:36.339
THERE'S REPUBLICANS THAT ARE

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:37.006
CONVENIENTLY TALKING ABOUT

00:09:37.007 --> 00:09:38.708
THINGS LIKE THE DEEP STATE AND

00:09:38.709 --> 00:09:41.877
TALKING ABOUT THE SURVEILLANCE

00:09:41.878 --> 00:09:43.145
APPARATUS IN A WAY THAT THEY'RE

00:09:43.146 --> 00:09:44.480
OFFENDED BY BUT THEY ARE THE

00:09:44.481 --> 00:09:45.881
ONED THAT ALLOWED THE STATE TO

00:09:45.882 --> 00:09:47.083
GET THIS BLOATED.

00:09:47.084 --> 00:09:48.317
AND THEY REALIZE PEOPLE IN

00:09:48.318 --> 00:09:50.586
POWER, ALL YOU HAVE TO DO IS SET

00:09:50.587 --> 00:09:52.655
A COUPLE OF TRAPS IN SECRET --

00:09:52.656 --> 00:09:53.656
THIS IS OPAQUE.

00:09:53.657 --> 00:09:55.758
WE HAVE NO IDEA HOW THIS COURT

00:09:55.759 --> 00:09:56.359
WORKS.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:58.394
WE REALLY DON'T KNOW HOW THE

00:09:58.395 --> 00:10:00.196
APPLICATION PROCESS WORKS.

00:10:00.197 --> 00:10:01.831
WHAT KIND OF OVERSIGHT THEY HAVE

00:10:01.832 --> 00:10:05.501
ONCE AN APPLICATION IS OKAYED

00:10:05.502 --> 00:10:08.270
AND YOU CAN --

00:10:08.271 --> 00:10:09.672
&gt;&gt; Dana: MAYBE THEY'LL CHANGE

00:10:09.673 --> 00:10:10.106
POLICIES --

00:10:10.107 --> 00:10:12.141
&gt;&gt; LIBERTARIANS HAVE BEEN

00:10:12.142 --> 00:10:13.209
BEGGING TO DO THAT FOR YEARS.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.243
&gt;&gt; Dana: WE DON'T KNOW WHAT THE

00:10:14.244 --> 00:10:14.677
RESULTS ARE.

00:10:14.678 --> 00:10:16.078
MAYBE THERE WAS A PROBLEM WITH

00:10:16.079 --> 00:10:16.712
THIS PARTICULAR ONE.

00:10:16.713 --> 00:10:17.813
I DON'T THINK THAT MEANS THAT

00:10:17.814 --> 00:10:19.348
THE ENTIRE FISA COURT PROCESS OF

00:10:19.349 --> 00:10:21.817
WHICH HAS BEEN VERY USEFUL IN

00:10:21.818 --> 00:10:24.920
TERMS OF PROTECTING NATIONAL

00:10:24.921 --> 00:10:26.856
SECURITY SHOULD BE THROWN OUT.

00:10:26.857 --> 00:10:28.791
&gt;&gt; OPEN IT UP --

00:10:28.792 --> 00:10:32.995
&gt;&gt; AND WHERE IS THE FISA JUDGE?

00:10:32.996 --> 00:10:34.130
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: IF THE JUDGE WAS

00:10:34.131 --> 00:10:34.764
LIED TO --

00:10:34.765 --> 00:10:35.831
&gt;&gt; BRING THEM BACK IN.

00:10:35.832 --> 00:10:37.266
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: THAT'S WHAT THE

00:10:37.267 --> 00:10:40.302
INVESTIGATION BY THE I.G. WILL

00:10:40.303 --> 00:10:41.637
UNCOVER.

00:10:41.638 --> 00:10:45.908
I BET THEY DID WIRETAP THE TRUMP

00:10:45.909 --> 00:10:46.275
TOWER.

00:10:46.276 --> 00:10:50.146
I BET ALL OF THE PARANOIA WILL

00:10:50.147 --> 00:10:51.113
COME TRUE.

00:10:51.114 --> 00:10:53.582
&gt;&gt; Greg: HOW CONVENIENT IS IT

00:10:53.583 --> 00:10:54.984
NOW TO NEED THE WHISTLE-BLOWER

00:10:54.985 --> 00:10:55.317
ANYMORE?

00:10:55.318 --> 00:10:56.919
THE WHISTLE-BLOWER SHOWS UP,

00:10:56.920 --> 00:11:00.623
BLOWS HIS WHISTLE.

00:11:00.624 --> 00:11:02.491
SO WHAT THEY NEED IS THE

00:11:02.492 --> 00:11:03.359
WHISTLE-BLOWER TO FIND THE

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:03.726
CRIME.

00:11:03.727 --> 00:11:05.061
NOW THEY HAVE THE CRIME, THE

00:11:05.062 --> 00:11:06.729
WHISTLE-BLOWER CAN LEAVE.

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:08.464
&gt;&gt; Dana: HE WAS A FISA JUDGE.

00:11:08.465 --> 00:11:11.902
&gt;&gt; Greg: THAT'S WHO IT IS.

